# Projections of sources that already live in this repo — committing them would
# duplicate the same fact in two places and let it drift (see knowledge/experience.md,
# "重複的知識會獨立漂移"). Both are regenerated by `npx knowie update`.
# This only applies to knowie's own repo: in a *user's* project these are the
# real thing and belong in git.
#
# NOTE: no trailing comments on the pattern lines below — gitignore treats the
# whole line as the pattern, so `.claude/skills/  # copies` matches nothing.
.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/
knowledge/.templates/
